{"version":1,"content":"<p>調查宏福苑大火成因的獨立委員會報告今日（29日）對外公布，特首李家超和相關官員將在下午2時45分，於政府總部舉行報告相關事宜的記者會。</p><p>《明報》將持續更新記者會及報告詳情。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:46.627914+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:54:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:14.431120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:14.303122+00:00","content_hash":"6b6fa592464b376640458d44c8658904583c8385eaf2ec30b8f32549e487599a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}